  "contracts": [
    "Glyph index must belong to the supplied Font; fallback glyphs require actual resolved Font, or use existing GlyphRun.appendOutline.",
    "Native commands are copied to Shape and survive Font closure; failure may partially append, without transactional native mutation guarantee.",
    "64 independent cold Face/Font allocation budgets require both failure and success; invalid index, translation and expired Font are checked."
  ],
  "performanceBoundary": "1000 warmed reset/append rounds (2000 native calls) per mode compare C and language: zero XRT alloc/free/realloc on both platforms. Cold caches, capacity growth, common checked scopes and CPU time remain separate costs; no end-to-end zero-cost claim."
